<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-019" chapter-id="c-nanshi-019-nan19" source-id="s-nanshi-019-nan19-ws1531762">
  <p id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">朗子<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001:m0002" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAA">重</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001:m0005" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAA">景重</persName>，位會稽王道子驃騎長史。<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001:m0019" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAA">重</persName>生<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001:m0021" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAB">絢</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001:m0023" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAD">瞻</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001:m0025" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAA">晦</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001:m0027" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAE">㬭</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001:m0029" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAF">遯</persName>。<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p001:m0031" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAB">絢</persName>位至宋武帝鎮軍長史，早卒。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p002:m0000" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAD">瞻</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p002:m0002" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAD">宣遠</persName>，一曰名<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p002:m0008" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAD">簷</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p002:m0010" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAD">通遠</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p002:m0013" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAA">晦</persName>次兄也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">弟<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p003:m0001" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAE">嚼</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p003:m0003" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAE">宣鏡</persName>，年數歲，所生母<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p003:m0013" ref="d35_ba2_b9a">郭氏</persName>疾，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-nan19:p003:m0017" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAE">嚼</persName>晨昏溫凊，勤容戚顏，未嘗暫改。</p>
</text>
